@Clearance = http://localhost:5102

### Documents needed for a passport
GET {{Clearance}}/api/requirements/PASSPORT
Accept: application/json

### Clearance status of appointment 1
GET {{Clearance}}/api/appointments/1/clearance
Accept: application/json

### Submit documents for appointment 1 (returns 202 at once; the worker verifies in the background)
POST {{Clearance}}/api/appointments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documents": [
    { "documentType": "ID_COPY", "certifiedOn": "2026-10-20" },
    { "documentType": "PASSPORT_PHOTO" }
  ]
}

### Clearance status for several appointments at once
GET {{Clearance}}/api/clearances?appointmentIds=1&appointmentIds=2
Accept: application/json
